WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:03.712
[Thunderstorm, rain pouring]

00:00:11.662 --> 00:00:13.764
♪♪

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:18.390
♪♪

00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:20.797
WENWU
I gave you ten years to live your life.

00:00:21.371 --> 00:00:25.456
♪♪

00:00:26.686 --> 00:00:28.467
WENWU
And where did that get you?

00:00:31.724 --> 00:00:35.067
♪♪

00:00:36.678 --> 00:00:38.678
WENWU
You walked in my shadow.

00:00:38.857 --> 00:00:41.911
♪♪

00:00:45.519 --> 00:00:47.064
WENWU
I trained you...

00:00:48.683 --> 00:00:51.468
...so the most dangerous
people in the world...

00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:53.864
...couldn't kill you.

00:00:54.191 --> 00:00:56.387
♪♪

00:00:56.412 --> 00:00:57.744
WENWU
Son...

00:00:59.046 --> 00:01:02.907
...it's time for you to
take your place by my side.

00:01:02.907 --> 00:01:07.232
♪♪

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.403
SHANG-CHI
That's not going to happen.

00:01:12.521 --> 00:01:17.076
♪♪

00:01:20.644 --> 00:01:22.571
WENWU
You can't outrun...

00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:25.794
...who you really are.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.821
♪♪

00:01:33.469 --> 00:01:34.511
KATY
Who are you?

00:01:37.145 --> 00:01:39.704
♪♪

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:47.059
[Bus horn blaring]

00:01:47.084 --> 00:01:48.178
SHANG-CHI
Oh, God.

00:01:48.178 --> 00:01:49.443
KATY
Hold on, everybody!

00:01:49.756 --> 00:01:52.200
PASSENGERS
[Screaming]

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:56.320
KATY
[Screaming]

00:01:58.891 --> 00:02:00.245
KATY
We make a good team!

